ed feeder, bad radar echo.', 'Empty silo, closed gate, stalled feeder, bad radar echo.', 'Verify level and gate feedback, compare feed demand versus actual, inspect bridging under approved isolation. For unsafe/severe events use existing plant shutdown/fire/safety procedure. After repair, confirm with valid data and maintenance record.', 'Verify level and gate feedback, compare feed demand versus actual, inspect bridging under approved isolation.', 'D5 Rev.00 Table 9.4.3 legacy candidate, rewritten with evidence limits. Gate: Candidate anomaly can be raised using designated measurements; the root cause is not confirmed without disambiguation. Rev.01 (inputs updated): Extraction-gate status STS-FSL-01 replaced by six gate feedbacks POS-FSL-01…06 and purge step STS-FSL-03 (MoM-02); feed-bin level replaced by bin weight.', NULL, 1),
